end="0:53.977">ni a</span><span begin="0:53.977" end="0:54.207">na</span><span begin="0:54.207" end="0:54.357">ta </span><span begin="0:54.357" end="0:54.567">to </span><span begin="0:54.567" end="0:54.757">de</span><span begin="0:54.757" end="0:55.037">at</span><span begin="0:55.037" end="0:55.657">te</span></text><text for="L10"><span begin="0:55.641" end="0:55.971">i tsu</span><span begin="0:55.971" end="0:56.181">mo </span><span begin="0:56.181" end="0:56.331">a</span><span begin="0:56.331" end="0:56.461">na</span><span begin="0:56.461" end="0:56.701">ta </span><span begin="0:56.701" end="0:56.831">ni </span><span begin="0:56.831" end="0:57.191">tasu</span><span begin="0:57.191" end="0:57.411">ke</span><span begin="0:57.411" end="0:57.561">ra</span><span begin="0:57.561" end="0:57.871">re</span><span begin="0:57.871" end="0:58.221">te</span></text><text for="L11"><span begin="0:58.503" end="0:58.793">ba i</span><span begin="0:58.793" end="0:58.983">to </span><span begin="0:58.983" end="0:59.123">ga </span><span begin="0:59.123" end="0:59.483">tano</span><span begin="0:59.483" end="0:59.653">shi</span><span begin="0:59.653" end="0:59.863">mi </span><span begin="0:59.863" end="0:59.983">ni </span><span begin="0:59.983" end="1:00.373">nat</span><span begin="1:00.373" end="1:00.723">te</span></text><text for="L12"><span begin="1:00.933" end="1:01.303">jitsu </span><span begin="1:01.303" end="1:01.643">wa shi</span><span begin="1:01.643" end="1:01.773">fu</span><span begin="1:01.773" end="1:01.993">to </span><span begin="1:01.993" end="1:02.373">kabu</span><span begin="1:02.373" end="1:02.473">ru </span><span begin="1:02.473" end="1:02.713">you </span><span begin="1:02.713" end="1:02.833">ni </span><span begin="1:02.833" end="1:03.413">nerat</span><span begin="1:03.413" end="1:03.553">te</span><span begin="1:03.553" end="1:03.883">ta</span></text><text for="L13"><span begin="1:04.064" end="1:04.314">su</span><span begin="1:04.314" end="1:04.654">tan</span><span begin